dsh-session-toast README · Non-desktop:：> **Renamed in v0.2.0.** 0.1.x shipped as `dsh-session-notifier`, but that npm name is taken by an unrelated package from another author (a web client + WSL notifier), so installing "by name" pulled the wrong plugin. Since v0.2.0 the package name, plugin row id and GitHub repository are all **`dsh-session-toast`**. To upgrade:
>
> 1. **Remove** the old `dsh-session-notifier` in Plugins, including the unrelated npm `1.x` package if it was installed by name;
> 2. install `dsh-session-toast` as described above;
> 3. click **Install → Enable now** and confirm `# == dsh-session-toast` shows up in `--dump-config`.
